      "section": "3.2 Cost and evidence limitations",
      "content_type": "text",
      "element_index": 11,
      "text": "Maintenance spend increased from USD 12,000 to USD 18,000. The report does not provide sales\nprices, labor costs, or energy costs. Therefore, net profit and maintenance return on investment cannot\nbe established.",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        501.17,
