      "page_number": 3,
      "section": "3.2 Cost and evidence limitations",
      "content_type": "text",
      "element_index": 12,
      "text": "The driver estimates sum to the observed change, but this does not establish causation. Do not claim\nthat higher maintenance spending alone caused the efficiency gain. Findings apply only to Plant A and\nthe stated quarters.",
