      "section": "50 units per hour",
      "content_type": "text",
      "element_index": 4,
      "text": "Production efficiency = good units produced / (planned production hours x standard rate) x 100. The\nstandard rate is 50 units per hour. Planned hours include downtime. First-pass yield is a separate\nquality measure shown in Figure 1.",
